    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast Lap Racing is a game developed for car, engine, racing, and speed enthusiasts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OBJECTIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Set the best possible lap time on challenging tracks and dominate the global track rankings!\u00a0Challenge your skills and have fun driving real cars on detailed circuits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It combines realism with a fun driving feel, where each vehicle has its own physics and handling, accurately replicating:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engine parameters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspension system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Electronic systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aerodynamics impact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tire friction on the ground.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of cars, from popular models to high-performance sports cars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various circuits, including go-kart tracks and race tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed cockpit view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global ranking.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your car's appearance with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paintings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wheels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspension adjustments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Window tint</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase car performance with mechanical parts such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Air filters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exhaust systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remapping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turbochargers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weight reduction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tires</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate, push your limits, and prove that you're the fastest on the track!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast Lap Racing is a game developed for car, engine, racing, and speed enthusiasts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OBJECTIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Set the best possible lap time on challenging tracks and dominate the global track rankings!\u00a0Challenge your skills and have fun driving real cars on detailed circuits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It combines realism with a fun driving feel, where each vehicle has its own physics and handling, accurately replicating:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engine parameters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspension system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Electronic systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aerodynamics impact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tire friction on the ground.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of cars, from popular models to high-performance sports cars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various circuits, including go-kart tracks and race tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed cockpit view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global ranking.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your car's appearance with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paintings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wheels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspension adjustments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Window tint</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase car performance with mechanical parts such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Air filters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exhaust systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remapping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turbochargers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weight reduction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tires</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate, push your limits, and prove that you're the fastest on the track!</p>",
    "short_description": "Set the best time driving real cars on challenging tracks. Fast Lap Racing combines realism with fun, offering a wide variety of cars, from popular models to high-performance sports cars. Customize your car, improve its performance, and dominate the tracks.",
